      "text": "BROUGHTON RULES (1743):\n  Jack Broughton (\"Father of Boxing\"), former champion\n  -- First attempt at systematic rules\n  -- 30 seconds to reach scratch (return after knockdown)\n  -- No hitting below waist\n  -- Seconds cannot interfere while opponent down\n  -- No ground fighting\n  -- Context: Broughton established after fighter died\n     in his ring (George Stevenson, 1741)"
    },
