      "text": "**James J. Corbett (1866-1933)**: \"Gentleman Jim\" -- first heavyweight champion under Queensberry Rules. Bank clerk background, educated demeanor, known for scientific boxing over brawling. Corbett vs. Sullivan changed boxing's character: from pub-fight endurance to technical skill display."
